      "message": "It seems that the fixes in the backend should be minimal, as they should all be checking the there is a DS attachment before trying to switch-case on the Load/StoreOp. The only issues might be looking at one aspect (depth or stencil) that\u0027s not in the DS attachment.\n\nOtherwise it seems 3 would be fine, the frontend tries to reify things for the backends, which sometimes it might do a bit too much for the WebGPU backend, because it is a slightly special one (it is as expressive as the frontend\u0027s input because it is the same API, while other backends need less information for a bunch of things).",
